  evidence-test: FormatBytes_matches_web_binary_units.
Live data: none — the web page reads via the TanStack-Query useExportJobs hook (poll-while-active refetch),
  no useLiveX/SSE subscription, so no SSE wiring / >2-min staleness chip (ADR-013 n/a). The VM reloads the
  list after a successful bulk delete (web onSuccess invalidate), pinned by ViewModel_bulk_delete_runs_clears_selection_and_reloads.
Failure semantics: feed errors surface the TsErrorDisplay + Retry; a bulk-delete failure preserves the selection
  for retry (web onError toast leaves selection intact) — ViewModel_bulk_failure_keeps_the_selection.

